# Cloud Run `--source` upload. Keep this aligned with `.dockerignore`.
# Without it, gcloud follows `.gitignore` and still uploads ~1 GB of
# PriceCatcher monthly CSVs under data/open_dosm/2025 and 2026.

.git
.github
.firebase
.venv
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

frontend
docs
data
tools
dataconnect
**/*.md
backend/Price Forecast
backend/.venv
cv/artifacts
cv/scripts
cv/requirements-train.txt
frontend/.dart_tool
frontend/build
frontend/android/.gradle
*.log
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
